I kept getting an error from the Ant Design bundle saying it couldn't find the React module. I noticed my React bundle was importing from the Ant Design bundle just to use the Di() interop helper function:

function Di(e) { 
    return e && e.__esModule && Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(e, "default") 
        ? e.default 
        : e 
}

